		(at 30.525 40.8 -90)
		(descr "HanElectricity CPG151101S11-16 (LCSC/JLC C41430893) Kailh-type MX hot-swap socket, SMT on the side opposite the key switch. Recommended layout from the maker drawing: pads 2.55x2.5mm, switch-pin holes 3.00mm, pin spacing 6.35/2.54mm; plus the 4.0mm MX centre-post hole. Origin at the switch centre. Authored for flipping to the bottom side: the board builder mirrors local Y. Requires a 1.6mm PCB (MX pin length). Plate-mount (3-pin) and PCB-mount MX switches fit; peg holes are not provided.")
